{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52911","headline":"观佽飞斩蛟龙图赞 · 李白","name":"观佽飞斩蛟龙图赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佽飞斩长蛟，遗图画中见。\n登舟既虎啸，激水方龙战。\n惊波动连山，拔剑曳雷电。\n鳞摧白刃下，血染沧江变。\n感此壮古人，千秋（一作「载」）若对面。\n（见《李太白文集》卷二十八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}